### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get contact by id
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/69fdba7537ca411504a8a7d0

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Anna",
    "lastName": "Villanueva",
    "email": "annv@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Brown",
    "birthday": "1993/01/17"
}

### Update a contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/69fdba7537ca411504a8a7d0
content-type: application/json

